<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-NATAL BEAT ACT 35-26 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NATAL BEAT ACT 35-26 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN, South Africa 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal beat</p>
<p>Australian Capital Territory 35-26 (halftime 23-0) in their</p>
<p>Super 12 match at Kings Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Natal - Tries: Joos Joubert (3), Walter Minnaar.</p>
<p>Conversions: Gavin Lawless (3). Penalties: Lawless (3).</p>
<p>ACT - Tries: John Langford, Joe Roff, Marco Caputo, Stephen</p>
<p>Larkham. Conversions: Joe Roff (3).</p>
</text>
